l035","ordinal":191946,"en":"Without the giants of Burut"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b003:l036","ordinal":191947,"en":"that I did"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b003:l037","ordinal":191948,"en":"Saying that I killed his fangs,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b003:l038","ordinal":191949,"en":"To Chima-Ching, Beijing"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b003:l039","ordinal":191950,"en":"To put the truth,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l001","ordinal":191951,"en":"To the blood of Er Konurbai,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l002","ordinal":191952,"en":"In front of Chon Esenkan,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l003","ordinal":191953,"en":"Fourteen horses at all,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l004","ordinal":191954,"en":"To shoot,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l005","ordinal":191955,"en":"In a different way,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l006","ordinal":191956,"en":"Azar with his hands down,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l007","ordinal":191957,"en":"Muradyl from China"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l008","ordinal":191958,"en":"It's time to come."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l009","ordinal":191959,"en":"Burn red and purple"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l010","ordinal":191960,"en":"It is sad to be scouted,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l011","ordinal":191961,"en":"Icon-style,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l012","ordinal":191962,"en":"Appearance on horseback,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l013","ordinal":191963,"en":"Muradyl himself,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l014","ordinal":191964,"en":"Six thousand Chinese, like a number,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l015","ordinal":191965,"en":"There are so many soldiers."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l016","ordinal":191966,"en":"If the fraud does not know,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l017","ordinal":191967,"en":"How many hands are ahead,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l018","ordinal":191968,"en":"It's a long way,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l019","ordinal":191969,"en":"Come on, my children,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l020","ordinal":191970,"en":"Six sharp ones from the sky,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l021","ordinal":191971,"en":"The best of swords,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l022","ordinal":191972,"en":"Zulpukor who got Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l023","ordinal":191973,"en":"The inheritance from Manas"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l024","ordinal":191974,"en":"Er Semetey, you are bound."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l025","ordinal":191975,"en":"Achalbars, who won"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l026","ordinal":191976,"en":"Ai, Kanchoro, you are bound."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l027","ordinal":191977,"en":"Joikuma of Almambet,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l028","ordinal":191978,"en":"Er Kulchorom, you are bound."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l029","ordinal":191979,"en":"My children, even your ancestors are blood,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l030","ordinal":191980,"en":"Kydyr was cured from the bottom."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l031","ordinal":191981,"en":"Dumbaker's children,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l032","ordinal":191982,"en":"Your ancestors are all blood,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l033","ordinal":191983,"en":"Kydyr was treated from the beginning"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l034","ordinal":191984,"en":"A descendant of Balaket."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l035","ordinal":191985,"en":"Don't be childish, be brave."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l036","ordinal":191986,"en":"If you are a man, my servants,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l037","ordinal":191987,"en":"Serve alongside your father."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l038","ordinal":191988,"en":"If you don't have the courage,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0076:b004:l039","ordinal":191989,"en":"Fall into the night without being born,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0077:b003:l001","ordinal":191990,"en":"Die without living!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0077:b003:l002","ordinal":191991,"en":"He died in agony"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0077:b003:l003","ordinal":191992,"en":"Put it on the wall"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0077:b003:l004","ordinal":191993,"en":"The name you touched before,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0077:b003:l005","ordinal":191994,"en":"If you are human, my children,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0077:b003:l006","ordinal":191995,"en":"Intervene!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0077:b003:l007","ordinal":191996,"en":"If the shotgun goes off,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0077:b003:l008","ordinal":191997,"en":"Don't panic and boil salt."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0077:b003:l009","ordinal":191998,"en":"If the black gun goes off,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0077:b003:l010","ordinal":191999,"en":"Do not run away and boil the salt."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0077:b003:l011","ordinal":192000,"en":"Listen to my speech,"}]
